38
00:01:37,967 --> 00:01:39,726
Where does soap come from?

39
00:01:40,047 --> 00:01:42,366
Fats and oils are triglycerides.

40
00:01:42,767 --> 00:01:45,566
Each one is glycerol, a small molecule with

41
00:01:45,647 --> 00:01:48,366
